                                "sense_id": "b63f0aa1-0394-3319-b1ed-c838183c83fe",
                                "text": "Nervousness, fatigue, brain-exhaustion . . . had her fight against them been vain? What was the use of all the months and years of patient Taylorized effort against the natural human fate: against anxiety, sorrow, old age—if their menace was to reappear whenever events slipped from her control?"
